WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.790
- I heard you took a very different

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.110
approach to writing this record.

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:05.320
You kind of like went off the grid, right?

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.320
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.400
- So I-
- Like how off the grid?

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:11.700
- I was heavily on all the
social media and everything,

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.820
and just constantly on my phone.

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:16.482
And I was like, I gotta just
step away from everything,

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:18.740
take some time for myself.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.548
I got a flip phone.

00:00:20.548 --> 00:00:21.381
- A flip phone, like?

00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:23.180
- Yeah, I mean, straight
up hang up on somebody

00:00:23.180 --> 00:00:24.670
and close it, you know?

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:25.520
Make a point kind of-

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.180
- The only thing better would
have been a beeper, but okay.

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.180
- Yeah, that's next.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.677
That's my next stage for my next album.

00:00:30.677 --> 00:00:33.620
But it just really made me kinda
focus on myself for a while

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:35.020
and just kinda figure
out what I wanted to say,

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.430
who I wanted to be, and
started journaling a lot more.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.210
I got a Polaroid camera,
was taking photos,

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.280
actually making everyone count.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.340
Every picture wasn't perfect.

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:42.173
You know, when you have a phone,

00:00:42.173 --> 00:00:45.010
you can take 4,000 pictures and pick one.

00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:46.970
It's like Polaroid, you've
gotta make that moment count.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.523
So just doing stuff
like that really made me

00:00:48.523 --> 00:00:50.920
reflective of my life, where I was

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.214
and where I am and where
I wanna go with it.

00:00:53.214 --> 00:00:54.047
- Slow down and appreciate it.

00:00:54.047 --> 00:00:56.290
- Slow it down, yeah.
- So I think that's why

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.123
I love this record so much.

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:57.956
- There's never a moment for yourself.

00:00:57.956 --> 00:00:59.640
- It feels real, like a real album.

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.710
- Yes, well thank you.

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:04.160
- Yeah, and actually, I
think it was Blake or Gwen,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.041
one of them, was the one who
turned me on to it at first.

00:01:06.041 --> 00:01:08.710
And I was like, oh, I was
like, I gotta check that out.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.490
But it's really well done as an album,

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:12.430
it sounds like an album.
- Well, thank you.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:13.763
- Yeah.
- I appreciate that.

